"j14n4bn98qbt": {
"body": "Between 6:00 PM ET on 9/9 and 11:30 AM ET on 9/10, a subset of users starting a bank connection through the web experience may have received an authorization error and been unable to complete the connection. The cause was a timing issue in our connection flow when the institution page loaded and began its requests before the underlying link session had finished initializing, causing those requests to be rejected.\nA fix has been deployed and the issue is resolved.",
